 "<br><br><font color='#d21aff'><b>SPECIAL SKILL</b></font><br>": "Mod.java",
 "<b>Vortex decoy</b>: when a missile locks on, 33% chance to release a vortex that pulls the missile away.": "Mod.java",
 "<b>Phase hull</b>: animated alien hull with enemy-grade handling (instant thrust, hard braking). Pair it with the Banshee Beam.": "Mod.java",
 "<b>Vortex decoy</b>: 80% chance to release a vortex when a missile locks on.<br><b>Root shot</b>: every 15 s, automatically fires an electric shot that pins the nearest enemy (within 2000) in place for 8 s.<br>Equip the <b>Regent Hive Bay</b> to launch Banshee and Arwing drones.": "Mod.java",
 "<b>Twin swivel mounts</b>: two independent rotating cannons, bow and stern.": "Mod.java",
 "<b>Kinetic ram</b>: deals damage to anything it hits while its shield is up.": "Mod.java",
 "<b>Twin missile tubes</b>: fires two missiles per launch.": "Mod.java",
 "Alien beam emitter salvaged from a Banshee UFO, the same weapon its pilots use against you.<br><br>It locks onto the closest enemy in front of your ship and fires short red beam pulses. Each pulse lands once per reload, never misses, but only reaches targets within short range (600).<br><br>Works on fixed-cannon and turret ships alike.": "Mod.java",
 "The purple venom beam of the Regent command ship.<br><br>Pulsed, auto-targeted and reaches twice as far as the Banshee Beam (1200). Each pulse can inject a long-lasting alien poison into the target.<br><br>Works on fixed-cannon and turret ships alike.": "Mod.java",
 "The green plasma cannon of the Arwing interceptor.<br><br>Fires fast alien plasma bolts at a high rate. Lower damage per bolt than human lasers, but very quick reload.": "Mod.java",
 "Heavy turret battery taken from a SPARTAN Guardian-class cruiser.<br><br>Slow, hard-hitting and very fast shells. Best mounted on the three turrets of the Megatron.": "Mod.java",
 "<b>A missile modification defines the characteristics of the missile you fire.</b><br><br>Heavy homing missile carried by Guardian-class cruisers. Huge payload and blast radius, slow to manoeuvre. Ships with two launch tubes fire a salvo of two.": "Mod.java",
 "<b>Replaces your missiles with alien drones.</b><br><br>Each launch uses one missile from your hold and releases 1 Banshee UFO and 1 Arwing (at most one of each out at a time). Drones are always built at your current pilot level and kills made by drones count as yours.<br><br><b>Stance</b>: while drones are out and the bay is reloading (or full), tap the missile button to switch:<br><b>Defense</b> (default): drones stay within 900 of your ship and deal +25% damage.<br><b>Attack</b>: drones hunt anything within 2500 but deal 15% less damage.<br><br>Higher tiers make stronger, longer-lived drones and reload faster.": "Mod.java",
 "SPARTAN Guardian-class cruiser, the Megatron class of the Spartan HQ patrols. Three heavy rotating turrets and twin missile tubes. Acceleration is glacial. Armor is not a concern.": "Mod.java",
 "<b>Spartan Aegis</b>: SPARTAN shield technology. Any equipped shield gets +50% capacity, twice the regeneration rate and half the recovery delay.<br><b>Point defence</b>: automatically shoots down a missile locked on you (every 2.5 s).<br><b>Repulsion wave</b>: every 1.5 s, pushes away any enemy within 350 of the hull.": "Mod.java",
