 "Queen of the Hive": "ModBoss.java",
 "Long-range scanners picked up an enormous Banshee UFO hunting convoys in the <b>Hermes</b> sector. Pilots call her the Matriarch.<br><br><b>Known behaviour</b>: she blinks next to her prey every few seconds, and below a third of her hull she calls Arwing escorts, burns twice as hard and blinks more often.<br><br><b>Reward</b>: Banshee Beam Lev. 5 and Arwing Plasma Bolt Lev. 5.": "ModBoss.java",
 "A Guardian-class cruiser has stopped answering SPARTAN command codes and is shelling traffic in the <b>Solar Field</b>. SPARTAN wants it gone before the press hears about it.<br><br><b>Known behaviour</b>: repulsion shockwaves that also burn your hull if you get within 450, heavy missile salvos, and at two thirds and one third of its hull it raises an invulnerable SPARTAN shield for 6 seconds and launches two Defensor escorts.<br><br><b>Reward</b>: Megatron Heavy Battery Lev. 10 and Megatron Salvo Missile Lev. 10.": "ModBoss.java",
 "The alien hive has crowned an Empress. Her command ship sits deep in <b>The Hive</b>, spawning broods without end.<br><br><b>Known behaviour</b>: everything a Regent does, plus volleys of three rooting shots every 8 seconds, a venom aura that burns anything within 500, and once she drops under 30% she regenerates 20% of her hull and releases two Banshees.<br><br><b>Reward</b>: Regent Venom Beam Lev. 15 and Regent Hive Bay Lev. 15.": "ModBoss.java",
 "Target destroyed. The reward has been transferred to your hold.": "ModBoss.java",
