 "Mod v16: Ship tree (Ships screen), Inbox, Sort and Sell junk buttons in shops, confirm before selling Rare+ items, where-to-find lines in item descriptions, ship comparisons, gate and galaxy-map level ranges, damage numbers, bar numbers, screen shake, optional floating joystick and bigger buttons (Settings), free repairs for Tech I hulls, sector police, and two titans at level 17: Leviathan and the new Crimson Throne.": "ModQol.java",
 "Mod v16.5 economy: enemies now pay a credit bounty that grows with their level (bosses pay 8x, elites 2x; nothing for enemies 4+ levels below you), story missions pay 3x credits, gear sells for 25% of its value instead of 15%, and ship prices were rebalanced (battleships about 1.1-2M, Nebula Moth 3.5M, Crimson Throne 6M, Leviathan 7M).": "ModQol.java",
 "Mod v16.6: shop and inventory lists now scroll clear of the mod toolbar, so the last BUY/SELL/DETAILS buttons are always reachable. Stations have a new Gift code button.": "ModQol.java",
 "Mod v16.8: scrollbars stay visible on every scrollable screen (item details, missions, lists, settings), and long ship descriptions scroll inside their box with a scrollbar. Fixed the Ships screen crash.": "ModQol.java",
 "Mod v17 capital ships: engine plumes, running lights, auras and wakes on the top tier of every class; big hulls now show smoke, fire, scorch marks and hull cracks as they take damage (they disappear once repaired), plus a visible self-repair effect. Titans get new turrets with heavier shots, siege missiles with a wider blast, and a manual EVE-style doomsday: Leviathan and X-0 fire a sustained lance, the Crimson Throne a furnace nova. Press DOOMSDAY at the bottom of the screen.": "ModQol.java",
 "Mod v19: six new weapon families (Railgun, Autocannon, Artillery, Blaster, Disintegrator, Arc Projector) in 4 tiers at laser shops (Ventohigh, Spartan HQ, smugglers, Omicron Prime) and as rare drops. Each faction now keeps a flagship at its HQ (Spartan HQ, Pirate Bay, The Hive, Omicron Prime, Ore Belt, Heliostat, Highway): neutral unless you deal 10% of its hull or attack civilians near it. The DEV kit now only fits the X-0 and swaps in and out with it. Doomsday lances are as wide as 60% of the titan.": "ModQol.java",
 "Mod v20: the doomsday lance is now a solid band as wide as its damage area. Railgun slugs and artillery shells are larger and leave trails. Fixed a crash when Android restored the Ships screen after closing the game in the background.": "ModQol.java",
 "Mod v21: the seven factions now have commanders and story chains (21 missions). Fly to a faction HQ and press HAIL to talk to its commander aboard the flagship: Spartan HQ, Pirate Bay, The Hive, Omicron Prime, Ore Belt, Heliostat, Highway. Chains open from level 10 and end in battles beside, or against, the flagships. The Leviathan and Crimson Throne have new hulls and turrets, and every faction flagship has new turrets.": "ModQol.java",
 "Mod v22: faction STANDINGS (toolbar button). Missions (+15, finale +20) and contracts (+6) raise your standing; allies share half, enemies lose half. Friendly: +10% payouts, the flagship forgives 25% friendly fire. Trusted: +20%, the flagship gives fire support and its HQ sells a secret faction weapon. Honored: +35% and a secret ship (coming next). Each HQ now offers two daily contracts, or amends jobs if you are Unfriendly. New flagship, Nebula Moth and faction emblem art, weapon-family icons, and combat sounds (alerts, all clear, disengaging enemies, low hull alarm, shield collapse).": "ModQol.java",
 "Mod v23: 21 Exceptional hulls redrawn (each with its own engine glow; Shade, Hornet, Raptor, Sanctum, Bulwark, Warlord, Harbinger and Tempest now belong to factions). Weapon families bring their own turrets: rails, rotary cannons, artillery barrels, blasters, prism emitters and tesla coils, sized to the hull. Seven secret faction ships appear on the Ships screen at Trusted and can be bought at Honored: SRS Resolute, Pillager's Due, Cradle of Echoes, Indemnity Crown, Foundry Sentinel, Far Meridian, Wayfarer Prime.": "ModQol.java",
 "Mod v24: the Ships screen is now a faction tech tree (tap a faction emblem, tap a ship for its card, OPEN for its page; BACK returns to the tree). My Ship is a fitting view: hull art with hardpoints, slots around it, full stats; CLASSIC switches back. Shields hug the hull and glow on it while up. A collapsed shield reboots in 1.3 s once above 50% hull and once more below; after that it recharges at half speed until you use a repair. The original alien hulls (Rat, Ufo, Blatte) now sit in the Kre'tari Brood tree. Ship art is back at full resolution and loads only when needed.": "ModQol.java",
 "Mod v25: Spanish! Settings > Language / Idioma (Auto, English, Espanol); restart the game after switching. 15 more hulls redrawn in their new factions' styles (Viper, Bastion, Albatros, Mule, Tortoise, Monolith, Comet, Kite, Seraph, Bulldog, Ironside, Tidewarden, Mantis, Verdant, Imperator) with new lore; new Ships tree and fitting screen art; a new shield bubble with hit ripples; new doomsday charge, nova ring, lance core and explosion effects.": "ModQol.java",
