 "Gold-plated, slow and absolutely devastating at range.": "ModShips.java",
 "Leviathan": "ModShips.java",
 "<b>Titan</b>: +25% laser damage, +50% shield capacity, six heavy turrets (2.5x damage per shot), four siege-missile tubes (1.9x damage, 55% wider blast, slower reload).<br><b>Doomsday Lance</b> (DOOMSDAY button): 2.5 s charge, then a 4 s lance straight ahead (2800 range, 60% as wide as the hull) that wipes everything in its path; mission bosses lose ~8% of their hull per lance and titan-class capitals ~2.5% (they take dozens). The titan cannot move, turn or fire while it charges and fires. 90 s cooldown.": "ModShips.java",
 "The Leviathan anchors a Republic defense line; its lance waits until every civilian convoy is clear.": "ModShips.java",
 "Comet": "ModShips.java",
 "Racer": "ModShips.java",
 "<b>Racer</b>: the fastest Tech I hull in the game.": "ModShips.java",
 "A Helion racer made to turn a clear route into a record; its light frame rewards speed over a fair duel.": "ModShips.java",
 "Kite": "ModShips.java",
 "Escort": "ModShips.java",
 "<b>Escort</b>: +15% shield capacity.": "ModShips.java",
 "A compact patrol frigate sold on one promise: help will find you before the route closes.": "ModShips.java",
 "Talon": "ModShips.java",
