 "Black hull, red eyes. Helion denies building it.": "ModShips.java",
 "Seraph": "ModShips.java",
 "Escort destroyer": "ModShips.java",
 "<b>Escort destroyer</b>: +15% shield capacity, one rotating cannon.": "ModShips.java",
 "The Authority sends Seraphs ahead of its convoys, where a bright beacon can matter as much as a gun.": "ModShips.java",
 "Aurora": "ModShips.java",
