 "Helion's prestige destroyer: more shield emitter than hull.": "ModShips.java",
 "Raven": "ModShips.java",
 "Bomber": "ModShips.java",
 "<b>Bomber</b>: twin missile tubes and 35% faster missile reload.": "ModShips.java",
 "Stealth-coated bomber with two internal launch bays.": "ModShips.java",
 "Bulldog": "ModShips.java",
 "<b>Brawler</b>: double hull plating and two rotating cannons.": "ModShips.java",
 "A Reaver brawler with room for two cannons and no patience for a captain who breaks crew trust.": "ModShips.java",
 "Ironside": "ModShips.java",
 "Gun cruiser": "ModShips.java",
 "<b>Gun cruiser</b>: three cannon turrets, +10% laser damage, heavy armour.": "ModShips.java",
 "Three patrol hulls became one Ironclad cruiser, reinforced wherever the miners said the first one failed.": "ModShips.java",
 "Foundry": "ModShips.java",
