 "<b>Foundry</b>: cargo hold x2.5 and on-board repair works (0.5% hull per second).": "ModShips.java",
 "Mobile refinery and repair yard in one ugly hull.": "ModShips.java",
 "Tidewarden": "ModShips.java",
 "Picket": "ModShips.java",
 "<b>Picket</b>: 8% faster laser reload, one rotating cannon.": "ModShips.java",
 "A Frontier picket watches the public lane and holds its mark until a rescue signal answers.": "ModShips.java",
 "Cobalt": "ModShips.java",
 "Gunboat": "ModShips.java",
 "<b>Gunboat</b>: +20% laser damage, two wing turrets.": "ModShips.java",
