 "Mantis": "ModShips.java",
 "Strike cruiser": "ModShips.java",
 "<b>Strike cruiser</b>: +5% damage, 5% faster reload, three laser turrets.": "ModShips.java",
 "A Republic strike cruiser that leaves formation only when a fast response can protect the whole patrol.": "ModShips.java",
 "Hydra": "ModShips.java",
 "Support cruiser": "ModShips.java",
 "<b>Support cruiser</b>: repairs 0.8% hull per second and +30% shield regeneration.": "ModShips.java",
 "Field-repair cruiser of the Syndicate's long-range fleets.": "ModShips.java",
 "Cardinal": "ModShips.java",
 "Heavy assault cruiser": "ModShips.java",
 "<b>Heavy assault</b>: +35% laser damage.": "ModShips.java",
 "Crimson-plated assault cruiser, the Syndicate's enforcer.": "ModShips.java",
 "Verdant": "ModShips.java",
 "<b>Line battlecruiser</b>: +15% shield, +5% damage, twin missile tubes.": "ModShips.java",
 "Built to bridge escort and battleship duties, Verdant carries a Republic line forward without leaving it exposed.": "ModShips.java",
 "Sovereign": "ModShips.java",
 "Command battlecruiser": "ModShips.java",
 "<b>Command ship</b>: +35% shield capacity and +30% shield regeneration.": "ModShips.java",
 "Gold-trimmed flagship of Syndicate fleet commanders.": "ModShips.java",
 "Sunlance": "ModShips.java",
 "Artillery battlecruiser": "ModShips.java",
 "<b>Artillery</b>: +40% laser damage, 10% slower reload.": "ModShips.java",
 "A spine-mounted gun with a battlecruiser wrapped around it.": "ModShips.java",
 "Graywall": "ModShips.java",
 "Bulk freighter": "ModShips.java",
 "<b>Bulk freighter</b>: cargo hold x5.": "ModShips.java",
 "The largest hold in the Syndicate. Mostly empty space and paperwork.": "ModShips.java",
 "Imperator": "ModShips.java",
 "<b>Line battleship</b>: +20% shield capacity and an enormous hull. Twin missile tubes.": "ModShips.java",
 "An Ironclad battleship made to hold ground long enough for settlement crews to evacuate behind its armor.": "ModShips.java",
 "Wraith": "ModShips.java",
 "Strike battleship": "ModShips.java",
 "<b>Strike battleship</b>: +35% laser damage and 10% faster reload.": "ModShips.java",
 "Violet-hulled battleship built to end fights quickly.": "ModShips.java",
 "Bastille": "ModShips.java",
 "Siege fortress": "ModShips.java",
 "<b>Siege fortress</b>: +60% shield capacity, +40% shield regeneration, the thickest battleship hull.": "ModShips.java",
 "When the Syndicate wants to stay somewhere, it parks a Bastille there.": "ModShips.java",
 "Nebula Moth": "ModShips.java",
 "Carrier": "ModShips.java",
 "<b>Carrier</b>: can mount any Regent Hive Bay and its drones deal +30% damage. Huge hull, +25% shield capacity.": "ModShips.java",
 "A Syndicate carrier: wings of hangars around a fragile spine.": "ModShips.java",
 "Crimson Throne": "ModShips.java",
 "Raider titan": "ModShips.java",
 "<b>Raider titan</b>: +45% laser damage, 10% faster reload, six heavy plasma cannons (2.5x damage per shot), four siege-missile tubes (1.9x damage, 55% wider blast, slower reload).<br><b>Furnace Nova</b> (DOOMSDAY button): 2 s charge, then a 3.5 s ring of fire that grows to 1400 around the hull and burns everything inside. The titan cannot move, turn or fire while it charges and burns. 75 s cooldown.<br><b>Furnace core</b>: the hull slowly repairs itself in combat (0.4% per second).": "ModShips.java",
 "The Reavers' throne-ship. A furnace with a hull bolted around it, and a crew that likes it that way.": "ModShips.java",
 "Test prototype": "ModShips.java",
 "<b>DEV ONLY</b> (gift code): 3x laser damage, half reload time, 4x shield, 2.5x missile reload speed, 10x cargo.<br><b>Doomsday Lance</b> (DOOMSDAY button, 12 s test cooldown) and <b>carrier bays</b>.<br><b>Phase Pulse</b>: every 6 seconds a green shockwave hits enemies within range.<br><b>Self-repair</b>: 2% hull per second.": "ModShips.java",
 "A test bed bolted together by the mod's developers. It should not exist, and nobody will sell you one.": "ModShips.java",
 "SRS Resolute": "ModShips.java",
 "Fleet escort": "ModShips.java",
 "<b>Fleet escort</b> (Honored with the Spartan Republic): +60% shield capacity, +40% shield regeneration, +10% laser damage.": "ModShips.java",
 "The Resolute takes the first strike in a mixed patrol and holds position until every Republic vessel can withdraw.": "ModShips.java",
 "Pillager's Due": "ModShips.java",
 "Close-range raider": "ModShips.java",
 "<b>Close-range raider</b> (Honored with the Crimson Reavers): +50% laser damage, 10% faster reload, slow hull self-repair.": "ModShips.java",
 "Crews earn the Due by surviving a season aboard it; its mismatched armor is a record of every ship that failed to take it.": "ModShips.java",
 "Cradle of Echoes": "ModShips.java",
 "Brood courier": "ModShips.java",
 "<b>Brood courier</b> (Honored with the Kre'tari Brood): repairs 1.5% of its hull every second, +30% shield regeneration, can mount any Regent Hive Bay (+30% drone damage).": "ModShips.java",
 "The Cradle carries memory keepers between nests, its paired pods pulsing with the shared history of every broodling aboard.": "ModShips.java",
 "Indemnity Crown": "ModShips.java",
 "Convoy interdiction": "ModShips.java",
 "<b>Convoy interdiction</b> (Honored with the Varn Syndicate): cargo hold x3, +25% laser damage, +30% shield capacity.": "ModShips.java",
 "The ship appears on the ledger as a secure transfer vessel; its protected core ensures the Syndicate's most important cargo arrives intact.": "ModShips.java",
 "Foundry Sentinel": "ModShips.java",
 "Settlement defender": "ModShips.java",
 "<b>Settlement defender</b> (Honored with the Ironclad Militia): repairs 1.5% of its hull every second, +40% shield capacity, +10% laser damage.": "ModShips.java",
 "The Sentinel is assembled from workshop-standard plates, so a settlement can mend it even when the nearest shipyard is weeks away.": "ModShips.java",
 "Far Meridian": "ModShips.java",
 "Long-range route runner": "ModShips.java",
 "<b>Long-range route runner</b> (Honored with the Helion Combine): the fastest battlecruiser, +20% laser damage, 10% faster reload.": "ModShips.java",
 "The Far Meridian keeps a convoy moving across distant systems, with collectors shaped to work far from a friendly station.": "ModShips.java",
 "Wayfarer Prime": "ModShips.java",
 "Deep-range patrol": "ModShips.java",
 "<b>Deep-range patrol</b> (Honored with the Frontier Authority): +30% shield capacity, +25% laser damage, very fast for a cruiser.": "ModShips.java",
 "The Wayfarer Prime works beyond reliable comms, leaving a clear route marker wherever it finds a stranded crew.": "ModShips.java",
